# NexusAI vs Oracle Fusion Cloud ERP — Full-Stack Parity Audit (v2)
## Financial Management Suite · March 8, 2026
### Evidence-Based · DB Tables · Backend Routes · UI Pages · Forms · Fields

> **Audit Methodology — Documentary Proof Standard**
