> 1. A confirmed file path under `src/pages/**` verified via `list_dir` tool
> 2. A confirmed route entry in [src/routes/FinanceRoutes.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/routes/FinanceRoutes.tsx) (531 lines, verified)
> 3. A confirmed grep result for TODOs/FIXMEs (tool output reproduced)
> 4. A confirmed fix commit with diff evidence

