## 🔧 Remaining Gaps — P3 Minor Only

All P1 and P2 items from the previous audit are now **RESOLVED**. The following are genuine P3 minor gaps only:

| Oracle Feature | Gap Description | Evidence | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|
| AP: Project/Task on Invoice Line | `APInvoiceEntry.tsx` invoice line type lacks `projectId`, `taskId`, `expenditureType` fields | Inspected line 66-80 of APInvoiceEntry.tsx | P3 |
| AP: Supplier IBAN/SWIFT Validation | Bank form captures account# but no regex IBAN/BIC format validation | Visual inspection of APSupplierDetail.tsx bank tab | P3 |
| AP: SEPA Direct Debit Format | Payment method selector has EFT/Check/Wire/ACH but no SEPA-DD option | Inspected CreatePPR.tsx payment method list | P3 |
| AR: Salesperson/Territory on Invoice | `ARInvoices.tsx` form missing `salesperson_id`, `territory_code` fields | Inspected ARInvoiceDetail.tsx header fields | P3 |
| Tax: Customer/Product Tax Exemptions | No dedicated tax exemption certificate setup page | Confirmed absence of `TaxExemptionSetup.tsx` | P3 |
| GL: Statistical Balance API Linkage | `StatisticalLedgerSetup.tsx` UI exists but does not call `/api/gl/statistical-balances` directly | Inspected StatisticalLedgerSetup.tsx (13 KB) — uses generic save call | P3 |

