## 📋 Mock Data Classification

The following files contain local `const` arrays used as **display data** (not backend stubs) — this is standard React practice for UI scaffolding with real API calls alongside:

- `CloseDashboard.tsx` — navigationCards array (static nav links, not mock data)
- `BalanceCubeInquiry.tsx`, `TrialBalance.tsx` etc. — all use `useQuery` hooks against `/api/*` endpoints

**Verdict: No components are using mock data as a substitute for real API calls.** All data queries use `@tanstack/react-query` with live `/api/finance/*` endpoints.

